<title>JAPAN: Milbon plans share split.</title>
<headline>Milbon plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milbon Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on February 10, for</p>
<p>shareholders as of December 20.</p>
</text>
